kds: CEO + management see every station; restricted flag on /my-stations

Two fixes for the Kitchen view shipped in 4b92b58:

1. CEO was being told "No stations assigned to you yet" — the endpoint
   treated empty User.stationIds the same for everyone. Now /kds/my-stations
   splits roles into two regimes:
     - Unrestricted: admin/CEO, management, foh_management, boh_management,
       expediter — always get every active station regardless of stationIds.
     - Station-bound: kitchen / boh — get only their roster (empty → empty).

2. Endpoint now returns `{ restricted, stations }` so the frontend can
   pick the right empty-state copy. Restricted + empty → "ask your manager".
   Unrestricted + empty (zero active stations in the tenant) → "open KDS
   Config to add stations" instead of misleading the CEO about an
   assignment he didn't need.

Migration 20260514120000_user_station_ids — applied to the dev DB; the
500 prior to this commit was Prisma client knowing the column but
Postgres not having it yet.

